IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MULTI-LORA-FOLKLORE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-CHIPS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 VIA-LINES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 ZP-REGISTERS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FOLK-BUS.
    IF NUM-CHIPS == 0 OR VIA-LINES == 0 OR ZP-REGISTERS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 89600 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-CHIPS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
